,$ then $F$ works against the motion of the particle as it moves from $B$ to $A.$\n\n![](images/38/38868b69ae1836844a279e141d83b886f386c87edeedbb1e2067ffd18d7f1af3.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259816 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179739 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "dab6bfb9-608d-5ff8-88e7-5aa9612acda4" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Sign of a Line Integral Over a Constant Vector Field"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b50d247-004f-5651-a394-b30eeeb529cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462199} {:answer/id #uuid "0acf4fbf-c960-5da4-a96f-3ce9d9922d69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0acf4fbf-c960-5da4-a96f-3ce9d9922d69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462200} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a3b6870-62fd-5213-83c5-45ea262cdc17" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462853} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e69bb018-78c2-57c3-90cf-d2ee9737a056" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462201} {:answer/id #uuid "354b8bcf-4809-560b-8402-8cd367efb2c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e69bb018-78c2-57c3-90cf-d2ee9737a056" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462201} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3499df4-bb30-5d3d-aa